description = "A port of the Geardox MS-DOS PC/AT emulator to libretro. This core emulates 386SX-20, 386DX-33, 486SX-33, 486DX2-66 and 486DX4-100 PC/AT machines with VGA and Cirrus Logic GD5428 SVGA video on ISA or VL-Bus, AdLib and Sound Blaster 1.5 to 16 sound, floppy, IDE hard disk and ATAPI CD-ROM drives, disk swapping, keyboard, PS/2 and serial mice, and joysticks. Games start directly from .gdox descriptors."
